CVS tag		Description

ASC_1_0         This revision contains the full package of ASC. It is the
		the superset of the ASC demo version 1.0 released through my
		website. However, version 1.0 is only compilable on UNIX
		platform, not Windows. Since I did not test it before I 
		use CVS to archive it. There are some minor compilation
		errors which can be easily fixed.

ASC_2_0		This revision of ASC is Cross-Platform. It can be compiled
		on Solaris and Windows. SGI platform is no longer supported.
		The major different is the handling of byte-order problem.
		